{"parse": {"title": "FX-03", "pageid": 55387, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FX-02\" title=\"FX-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FX-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/FX-04\" title=\"FX-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FX</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B0.83.E6.9F.A5.E6.89.8B.E5.86.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"调查手册\">调查手册</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 调查手册</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Investigator's Guidebook</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>稚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>嫩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>思<span class=\"color-value\"></span>索<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>郑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>重<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>迹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>份<span class=\"color-value\"></span>经<span class=\"color-value\"></span>验<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……这周围都有神秘术波动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>属于神秘术的丝线触角波动着收回，小春雀儿谨慎地得出判断，对先前得到的信息愈发笃信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷听是不礼貌的，但此刻她别无他法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>也……也许“秘密任务”确实存在。这种地方不应该有这么密集的神秘术施术痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>他们刚才，难道就是被这个术法迷惑了吗？这……好像是某种神秘术道具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>编外“童子军”陷入了苦思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>唔，无法确定……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探知的丝线又一次延伸了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不曾松懈的练习，理所当然的坚持。终于，她发现了童子军队伍以外的，生的气息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一点意外惊喜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>嗯……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小狗：</div><div>汪，汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>一只小狗？你在这里做什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小狗：</div><div>嗷——呜汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗亲密地拱着女孩的脚踝，做出了乞食的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而小春雀儿摸遍全身，也只找到半袋补充体力用的饼干棒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>你饿了吗？你吃饼干吗？我可以分给你一些——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小狗：</div><div>汪！汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>好的，我掰给你。地面上有灰尘……你可以在我的手上吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>来——哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗儿风卷残云般消灭了女孩掌心的饼干碎，精神起来，转身就要跑走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小狗：</div><div>嗷嗷！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>等等，那边没有——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>路……呃？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……至少，刚才确实没有。这是……这里有术法没有覆盖的缝隙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>还是说这里是一个建筑盲点？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>有可能，狗洞总是会出现在人们平视所注意不到的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>哦，这个拐角也位于我的右侧。不能忘记右手法则……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>好像可以更顺畅地进行探查了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小狗：</div><div>呜——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>引路的小狗低声呜咽了几声，而后迅速地逃窜了，就像一颗突兀出现又消失的肥皂泡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>咦……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小春雀儿踌躇不前。是活泼的狗儿，还是那个并不属于自己的任务？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>好吧……！先专注，找到泽维尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“神秘术的迷障绝不是完美的伪装，其中一定有漫不经心的破绽。”这是父亲教给她的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更仔细的观察，更冷静的分析。<br />泥水，污渍，皮鞋踩过的小小水洼，小狗儿奔跑的足迹……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>噢！脚印——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蹲下身来，搜寻可能存在的行人痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>唔……什么也没有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>外面有那种误导人的神秘术，父亲说过，他们能抹去存在的一切罪证。泽维尔说不定也擅长这个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>“当意识到这一可能性时，我们需要使用更有效的术法。当然，你得量力而行，孩子……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>再试试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深呼吸后，她再次发动了神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><b>《童子军手册》素养篇Ⅴ：谦虚谨慎，理性假设。</b></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>进展报告。进展，百分之十……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此处当然略去所有不必提及的小型事故。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呃，麻烦不要倒下来，不要倒——哇啊！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>好吧，第十四次清洁装置构架失败，空地不足，悬挂设施承重不足。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>但在重来之前……先让我看看污染量化结果……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>唔哦。看上去就算把整个工厂都用烟雾处理器和废水净化球填掉，也几乎完全没用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>真有趣。那为什么还要用这种装置呢？这种简单精确，但对要达成的目标毫无助益的设计，是否算一种——反向戈德堡装置？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……好吧，也可能他们只是拿错了东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哈哈，这没法解决问题。难道我不是来解决问题的吗？ </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我是来解决问题的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>好吧……让我们来看看这个号称拉普拉斯最新款的宝贝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哦！你有个不错的轴承。可以用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>现在，还有时间——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>还有时间“拯救”一下这个地方。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>嗯——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的呼吸急促了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我好像找到了什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工厂内部，生命共振的位置与施术痕迹大量地重叠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探知范围逐渐收拢，最终自动地汇集于一处，像磁石吸引四散的铁针。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“磁石”的中心，则被毫不遮掩的神秘学气息包裹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>是有人使用神秘术的气息，向北，中心第11根横梁侧后方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我找到了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>再这么等下去，太阳下山之前，我大概就用不上防毒面具了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接线员：</div><div>抱歉，拉普拉斯的援助人员正在赶往你所在位置的途中，请耐心等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>属于通讯器的电流声回荡在空旷无人的工厂内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“任务报告：主体首先失去嗅觉。大约一个小时后，陷入假性窒息。”如果运气好，我在晕过去之前不会吃太多苦头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>虽然现在似乎才刚到第一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>说真的——你们要不要先确认一下，那些援助人员有没有被自己人设置的迷障网拦住？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哦，这就挂断了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>那么，我就把这当作是对我自行其是的默认啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>如果真是被拦在外边了，那拉普拉斯岂不是做出了一件无法被破解，或者说，无法对其进行逆向工程的道具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>简直是梦寐以求的安全性，提前至少三十年的技术创新。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>虽然其他人不来确实更方便——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“意见驳回，请按照规章办事”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>规章驳回，请自由发挥～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>在能自由发挥的情况下，多个跑腿的人也不坏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嗯——差不多了。不过总觉得还缺少了一点更加无与伦比的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>是缺了什么呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>请问……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>缺了……嗯，嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>请问，你是泽维尔吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FX-03"}}